 "purpose": "Forward signal tracking only. Each entry is a frozen fast/slow oscillator rule gated by a recent regular divergence on the SLOW oscillator. Emitting BUY/SELL records an observation; it is not a recommendation and carries no order authority.",
 "tracking_only": true,
 "deployment_allowed": false,
 "capital_authority": false,
 "order_authority": false,
 "selection_rule": "Cells positive on BOTH the optimizer holdout and the retrospective confirmation segment, with at least 10 trades on each. 16 of 437 eligible multi-asset cells qualified, plus the separately-run BTCUSDT RSI 30m cell.",
